id: base64
path: base64.html
title: Base64
icon: 64
source: runtime/stdlib_codecs.cpp
description.ru: Стандартный RFC 4648 binary-to-text codec.
description.en: The standard RFC 4648 binary-to-text codec.
note.ru: Pure. Encode принимает Bytes, ByteSlice или ByteBuffer.
note.en: Pure. Encode accepts Bytes, ByteSlice or ByteBuffer.
drift_ignore:

method: Base64.encode(bytes, padding: true)
ru: Кодирует байты стандартным alphabet.
en: Encodes bytes with the standard alphabet.
example:
text = Base64.encode(Bytes.new("hello"))
# => "aGVsbG8="
.end

method: Base64.decode(text, mode: :strict)
ru: Декодирует текст в Bytes.
en: Decodes text into Bytes.
example:
value = Base64.decode("aGVsbG8=").to_str()
# => "hello"
.end
